<title>USA: Trinity Industries wins platform contract.</title>
<headline>Trinity Industries wins platform contract.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinity Industries Inc said Wednesday it received an order from TTX Co to build 1,200 intermodal platforms.</p>
<p>Trinity said it expects to begin deliveries in August.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the dollar value of the contract.</p>
</text>
